\pard\b\fs42 Nkambe Bakery Collection: Reader Guide and Source Register\b0\fs22\par\par \pard\sa120 Edition H3 \u8226? 8 October 2026\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 H3 correction and publishing status\b0\fs22\par \pard\sa120 H3 supersedes the EDC interpretation in H1 and H2. EDC is separate and unpriced. T01 cake doughnuts and H05 Danisa biscuits are held until EDC is identified and their methods and costs are completed. Their planned usable yields and unit-cost calculations have been withdrawn. All 92 affected historical variants are traceable in Nkambe_EDC_Correction_Register_H3.csv. Do not use the superseded merged quantities from older editions.\par \pard\sa120 The requested Investment Committee Memo template has been populated for the bakery. Its DOCX was cloned from the retained reference and rendered by installed Microsoft Word. The PDF and editable DOCX are included. No investment amount, valuation, market size or investor return is invented. The requested docs-report-publisher skill could not be found in the searched installed skill folders; the available document tools were used instead. No external publishing service was used.\par \pard\sa120 The H3 baguette workbook is a byte-for-byte copy of the checked H2 planner: BAG-H2-01 contains no EDC, and its formula, schedules and conditional capacity assumptions remain unchanged. References to the H2 model inside that workbook are intentional.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Start here\b0\fs22\par \pard\sa120 The working booklet contains 138 recipe and component cards: 13 Module 1 breads, 103 retained handbook cards, the revised cake-doughnut card, 20 additional adaptations, and the H3 direct-dough baguette card. It includes baguettes, softer breads, buns, cakes, biscuits, fried snacks, fillings, sauces, assembled meals, frozen desserts and yogurt. Start with this volume for production trials.\par \pard\sa120 The comparison volume preserves 254 historical numerical formula patterns plus 79 earlier handbook variant records. The research volume preserves 322 further recipes, collections, assemblies or recipe-bearing pages. These are record counts, not a claim that 796 distinct saleable products have been developed. Some sources overlap, and unresolved references remain on hold.\par \pard\sa120 EDC is not butter and must not be treated or priced as margarine. Its identity, specification, permitted application, dose and purchase price remain unresolved. Keep EDC as a separate historical ingredient and hold affected formulas until it is identified. The earlier owner-workbook butter-to-margarine instruction remains separate; true dairy butter in independent recipes retains its specification. Milk tantalizer and improver remain omitted from revised recipes.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 H3: baguette production programme\b0\fs22\par \pard\sa120 The exact scheduling source was found: S038, Staggered_Baguette_Production_Schedule.pdf, in the owner's Downloads folder. The separate H3 planning module identifies seven source candidates, explains contradictions, and supplies the new BAG-H2-01 direct-dough recipe. Existing poolish and soft baguette recipes retain their own methods. The revised programme is included in Volume 1.\par \pard\sa120 The earlier 505-piece claim does not allow for handling loss or the 80-piece oven-load assumption. H3 shows the original calculation, the corrected five-batch yield, and the extra loads needed. It also explains how a conditional 505-retained-piece target differs from 505 raw dough portions.\par \pard\sa120 All clock times below are local bakery planning times. Preparation starts at 02:00 and the first mix at 02:20. First packing release is 06:28; default first vehicle departure is 06:33 and retail arrival 07:03. These times are editable assumptions, not measured performance. A 45-minute cooling allowance does not by itself establish packing readiness.\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b Programme\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Raw portions / retained illustration\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Last packing release\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Commissioning: 2 half loads, 90-minute starts\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 80 / 78\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 07:58\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Normal: 5 full loads, 45-minute starts\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 400 / 390\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 09:28\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Extended: 10 full loads, 45-minute starts\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 800 / 780\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 13:13\cell \row \pard\fs22\par \pard\sa120 The 2% rejection allowance is rounded upward per batch. Actual rejects, sell-through and returns must be recorded. A nominal 300 g raw portion at 15% baking loss becomes 255 g; neither loss nor finished mass is guaranteed.\par \pard\sa120 At five baguettes per tray and sixteen trays per load, a full load holds 80. Confirm the layout with shaped dough, expansion and actual oven racks. The normal programme provisionally requires two full-rack proofing positions, four circulating tray/rack sets with a fifth as contingency, two cooling/packing rack positions, separate dispatch staging and a vehicle whose usable capacity is confirmed. Rack interchangeability and measured mixer minimum/maximum loads remain checks before release. Staffing reservations cover named tasks; quality monitoring, breaks and paid shift coverage must be demonstrated in a timed trial.\par \pard\sa120 If proofing takes 90 minutes, two proofing positions do not sustain the default cadence. If oven recovery takes the source's alternative 23 minutes, the default cadence also fails. Slow or stop mixing when downstream capacity is unavailable; the dough endpoint controls release.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Additional H3 files and planner use\b0\fs22\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b File\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Use\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Baguette_Production_Planning_H3.pdf / .rtf / .md\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Standalone scheduling chapter, editable text and technical source audit.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Baguette_Production_Planner_H3.xlsx\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Editable ingredients, scenarios, batch clocks, resource requirements, single-vehicle dispatch, costs and commissioning log.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Baguette_Layouts_and_Timeline_H3.pdf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Two landscape sheets: trial tray layout and normal-programme timeline.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Harmonization_Change_Log_H3.csv\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Source claims and H3 corrections.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Baguette_*_H3.csv\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Portable default schedules, dispatch, source review and resource bookings.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Verification_Record_H3.txt\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Final numerical, document and package checks, with limitations.\cell \row \pard\fs22\par \pard\sa120 Start with Readme and Inputs in the production planner. Change the assumptions, then inspect Scenarios, each schedule, Dispatch and Costing. Recalculate in Excel or another compatible spreadsheet application after editing. The planner contains checked default preview values; 1,392 formulas were evaluated and compared with a separate model. This is not a native Excel compatibility test. The general recipe-register workbook retains its separate formula/recalculation instructions.\par \pard\sa120 Unknown water, packaging, fuel, electricity, labour, transport and other costs are not zero. Full cost and contribution remain blank until the required inputs exist. Known ingredient subtotals are not net profit or a recommended selling price. CSV/PDF schedules and the resource-booking snapshot do not update when workbook inputs change. Generate a fresh resource plan and check actual staff, racks, proofers and vehicle conflicts before using changed assumptions.\par \pard\sa120 All 137 prior working cards, historical comparisons, research entries, safety controls and original source files were preserved. H3 adds one working baguette card and four ingredient lines, giving 138 working cards, 920 ingredient rows and 796 coverage records. Coverage counts include overlapping historical evidence and are not counts of unique products. The source inventory retains 590 local filename candidates and adds one separately identified external technical reference. Every working recipe still requires trial and release evidence.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Files and editing\b0\fs22\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b File / format\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Purpose\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Harmonized_Recipe_Booklet_H3.pdf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Volume 1 - Working recipes; 359 pages\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Formula_Comparison_H3.pdf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Volume 2 - Formula comparisons; 358 pages\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Research_Recipe_Archive_H3.pdf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Volume 3 - Research recipes; 403 pages\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Complete_Harmonized_Collection_H3.pdf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 This guide and all three volumes together. Printed page numbers restart within each volume; use the PDF bookmarks and local contents.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Harmonized_Recipe_Booklet_H3.rtf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Editable working booklet; opens in Word or another RTF editor.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Formula_Comparison_H3.rtf\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Editable historical comparison.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Editable_Recipe_and_Costing_Registers_H3.xlsx\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Prices, ingredient quantities, linked component costs, coverage, issues and sources.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 H3 CSV and Markdown files\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Portable editable copies of registers and all three text volumes.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Nkambe_Complete_Recipe_Package_H3.zip\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 All final H3 deliverables together; original source files are preserved in their original locations.\cell \row \pard\fs22\par \pard\sa120 In the workbook, edit the Prices sheet, then complete measured usable yields on Summary. Ingredient formulas and prepared-component subtotals recalculate when opened in a spreadsheet application. Blank prices remain unknown. Components carry their known ingredient subtotal per usable gram; they are incomplete while any component input is unpriced. Review each component\u8217?s recipe as well as the finished assembly.\par \pard\sa120 Summary has separate input cells for complete variable batch cost and selling price. Contribution is computed only when those fields and a saleable-unit count are supplied. Updating an ingredient quantity does not automatically redesign portion size, update every yield assumption or validate a process. Check those fields explicitly. Original missing-input notes and CSV values are export snapshots; they do not update with Excel edits. The linked workbook was structurally and arithmetically checked; it has not been opened in Excel for a native recalculation in this session.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Verification and practical limits\b0\fs22\par \pard\sa120 The staged search identified 590 filename candidates and 179 different file contents, plus relevant image screening. All candidates have a recorded disposition. Protected folders, long-path failures, cloud-only files and documents with unrelated filenames limit discovery. This is not a claim to have inspected every file on the computer.\par \pard\sa120 Working-card ingredient sums, commercial scaling factors, price extensions, component references, historical revisions and the corrected cake-doughnut total were checked programmatically. Unknown prices were not converted to zero. The bread poolish allocation and handling-loss convention were also checked. Three aggregated ingredient-register columns were excluded from the recipe count because they combined multiple recipes or represented multipliers rather than ingredient masses.\par \pard\sa120 PDF checks cover page count, extractable text and page-boundary overflow. Every working-card ID is present. The working volume was reviewed in page-contact overviews and selected pages at readable magnification; sample pages from the comparison and research volumes were also inspected. These checks are document-quality checks, not proof that every historical quantity or OCR numeral is correct. Small continuation pages can occur where a source record ends.\par \pard\sa120 The retained research pages preserve original quantities and wording, including disputed methods. They are comparison evidence, not production instructions. Review the issue printed before each record; C01\u8211?C05 in the working booklet override conflicting food-safety advice. Scanned pastry recipes and household measures need image checks, weighing and process development before adoption.\par \pard\sa120 No signed repeat-batch records were supplied. Full operating costs, sale prices, sale-through, shelf life, milk specifications and several equipment capabilities remain unresolved. All working formulas therefore require production trials; historical and research records are explicitly held where further specification is needed. This edition does not guarantee profitability or claim commercial validation of the complete source library.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Development and release priorities\b0\fs22\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b Priority\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Action / evidence\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 First pilot group\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Choose one everyday loaf, milk bun, baguette, T01 cake doughnut and H30 chin-chin. Record three independently acceptable trials before scaling.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Ingredient identities\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Check Top Milk type, Millac solids, Roma fat/salt and flour suitability; obtain missing quotes by edible or ready-to-use mass.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Facility checks\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Confirm tin dimensions, mixer load limits, fryer control, retail electrical load and verified cooling capacity.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Perishable foods\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Qualify meat cooling/reheat and frozen-samosa centre cook; qualify dairy treatment, chilling, culture and frozen storage.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Unique research products\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Preserve exact variants in the archive. Select individually, normalize household/OCR quantities, cost and validate before moving into the working series.\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx5000\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 Menu concepts without a full card\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 A menu idea or flavour name is a development gap, not an approved formula. Custom celebration/decorating formats, new beverage flavours, dietary claims and alternative pack sizes need separate specifications before sale.\cell \row \pard\fs22\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs28 Source register\b0\fs22\par \pard\sa120 Canonical sources are listed below. Exact duplicate paths and dispositions remain in Nkambe_Source_Inventory_H3.csv. The separate H3 production planner includes the scheduling-source audit.\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b ID\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Document and disposition\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Canonical path\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 S001\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual_updated.pdf \u8212? Related edition, supporting context or superseded source; no independent trial inferred\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 C:\\Users\\J COMPUTER\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-12\\x20-go\\docs\\bakery\\bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual_updated.pdf\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 S002\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.md \u8212? Related edition, supporting context or superseded source; no independent trial inferred\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 C:\\Users\\J COMPUTER\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-12\\x20-go\\outputs\\bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.md\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 S003\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.md \u8212? Related edition, supporting context or superseded source; no independent trial inferred\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 C:\\Users\\J COMPUTER\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-12\\x20-using-this-document-download-the\\docs\\bakery\\bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.md\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 S004\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.pdf \u8212? Related edition, supporting context or superseded source; no independent trial inferred\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 C:\\Users\\J COMPUTER\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-12\\x20-using-this-document-download-the\\docs\\bakery\\bakery_strategy_and_recipe_manual.pdf\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx3333\cellx6667\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 S005\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 Equipment_Gaps_and_Trial_Plan.md \u8212? Related edition, supporting context or superseded source; no independent trial inferred\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 C:\\Users